            <div class="timeline-marker">
              <div class="timeline-dot current"></div>
              <div class="timeline-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <div class="timeline-header">
                <div>
                  <span class="experience-badge current">Current Position</span>
                  <h4 class="timeline-role">Web Programming Intern</h4>
                  <h5 class="timeline-company">
                    <i class="fas fa-building me-2"></i>KPN Plantations
                  </h5>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-meta">
                  <span class="meta-item"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt me-1"></i> Aug 2026 - Present</span>
                  <span class="meta-item"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt me-1"></i> Jakarta, Indonesia</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <ul class="timeline-list">
                <li>
                  Mengembangkan dan memelihara fitur <strong>Enterprise GIS</strong> untuk manajemen pengguna, kontrol akses (access control), dan operasional perkebunan.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Mengimplementasikan logika backend dan <strong>SQL Stored Procedures</strong> untuk manajemen akses pengguna dan sinkronisasi status akun.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Mengembangkan dan mengintegrasikan modul konfigurasi <strong>Digital Approval System (DAS)</strong> serta migrasi fitur legacy ke dalam sistem Enterprise GIS.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Melakukan troubleshooting kendala aplikasi dan mengoptimalkan performa pemuatan data, filtering, searching, serta rendering antarmuka.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Melakukan functional testing, integrasi frontend dan backend, serta pengelolaan version control kode secara terstruktur menggunakan <strong>GitHub</strong>.
                </li>
              </ul>
              <div class="timeline-tags">
                <span class="tech-badge">Enterprise GIS</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">C# / ASP.NET</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">SQL Stored Procedures</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Digital Approval System</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Git &amp; GitHub</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Experience 2: PT Collega Inti Pratama -->
          <div class="timeline-item" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
            <div class="timeline-marker">
              <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
              <div class="timeline-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <div class="timeline-header">
                <div>
                  <span class="experience-badge">Internship</span>
                  <h4 class="timeline-role">Programmer, Internship</h4>
                  <h5 class="timeline-company">
                    <i class="fas fa-building me-2"></i>PT Collega Inti Pratama
                  </h5>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-meta">
                  <span class="meta-item"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt me-1"></i> Oct 2024 - Nov 2024</span>
                  <span class="meta-item"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt me-1"></i> Jakarta, Indonesia</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <ul class="timeline-list">
                <li>
                  Berkontribusi dalam pengembangan platform asuransi digital <strong>E-Polis</strong> menggunakan <strong>Vue.js</strong> dan JavaScript.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Mengembangkan <strong>RESTful APIs</strong> menggunakan <strong>Java Spring Boot</strong> dan mengintegrasikan basis data <strong>PostgreSQL</strong>.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Mengintegrasikan komponen frontend dan backend untuk mendukung fungsionalitas aplikasi dan berkolaborasi dalam tim guna merilis fitur yang handal dan teruji.
                </li>
              </ul>
              <div class="timeline-tags">
                <span class="tech-badge">Vue.js</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Java Spring Boot</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">PostgreSQL</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">RESTful APIs</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">E-Polis</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Experience 3: PT Properti Sekuriti Indonesia -->
          <div class="timeline-item" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
            <div class="timeline-marker">
              <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <div class="timeline-header">
                <div>
                  <span class="experience-badge contract">Contract Employee</span>
                  <h4 class="timeline-role">Security Systems Engineer</h4>
                  <h5 class="timeline-company">
                    <i class="fas fa-building me-2"></i>PT Properti Sekuriti Indonesia
                  </h5>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-meta">
                  <span class="meta-item"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt me-1"></i> Dec 2020 - Feb 2021</span>
                  <span class="meta-item"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt me-1"></i> Jakarta, Indonesia</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <ul class="timeline-list">
                <li>
                  Merancang, menginstalasi, dan mengonfigurasi sistem keamanan terpadu termasuk perangkat CCTV dan alarm, serta memastikan performa optimal melalui preventive maintenance rutin.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Mendiagnosis dan memperbaiki gangguan teknis atau malfungsi sistem keamanan secara cepat, sistematis, dan efektif.
                </li>
              </ul>
              <div class="timeline-tags">
                <span class="tech-badge">Security Systems</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">CCTV &amp; Alarm Configuration</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Diagnostic &amp; Repair</span>
                <span class="tech-badge">Preventive Maintenance</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Skills Section -->
