              <div class="soft-skill-pill"><i class="fas fa-users me-2"></i>Communication &amp; Team Collaboration</div>
              <div class="soft-skill-pill"><i class="fas fa-award me-2"></i>Hardworking &amp; Dedicated</div>
              <div class="soft-skill-pill"><i class="fas fa-compass me-2"></i>Leadership</div>
              <div class="soft-skill-pill"><i class="fas fa-lightbulb me-2"></i>Problem-Solving &amp; Critical Thinking</div>
